WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.170 --> 00:00:03.480
What happens when five male cadavers are put
through SCP-914?

00:00:03.480 --> 00:00:06.370
Dr. Grangan decided to find out.

00:00:06.370 --> 00:00:09.340
The first cadaver was placed in 914 on the
setting “Rough.”

00:00:09.340 --> 00:00:14.309
The output was a pile of human limbs, organs,
and bones, all separated via apparent tearing

00:00:14.309 --> 00:00:15.309
and heat.

00:00:15.309 --> 00:00:17.050
Dr. Grangan described this as “unsettling.”

00:00:17.050 --> 00:00:20.110
The next cadaver was run through on “Coarse.”

00:00:20.110 --> 00:00:24.380
What emerged was a pile of human remains,
with the organs and bones removed via a cutting

00:00:24.380 --> 00:00:28.930
tool, and the skin, nervous system, digestive
system, and circulatory system were removed

00:00:28.930 --> 00:00:30.420
with no damage at all.

00:00:30.420 --> 00:00:32.560
The third cadaver was placed in 914 on “1:1.”

00:00:32.560 --> 00:00:36.690
Though the cadaver that went in was Caucasian,
the one that came out was an Asian man.

00:00:36.690 --> 00:00:38.379
The next cadaver went in on “Fine.”

00:00:38.379 --> 00:00:41.699
It emerged with SCP-008 inside of it.

00:00:41.699 --> 00:00:43.530
The body was immediately destroyed.

00:00:43.530 --> 00:00:46.249
The final cadaver was placed in 914 on the
setting “Very Fine.”

00:00:46.249 --> 00:00:50.069
The output was green slime, with the properties
and chemical structure of SCP-447-2.

00:00:50.069 --> 00:00:57.070
The O5 Council declared that no more cadavers
were to be tested in SCP-914.

